      <li>Email <a href="mailto:hello@breathelio.com">hello@breathelio.com</a> with your order number and reason.</li>
      <li>We send a prepaid return label within 1 business day.</li>
      <li>Drop the package at your local carrier point.</li>
      <li>Refund issued within 5 business days of receiving the return.</li>
    </ol>
    <h4>What's covered</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>The Lio device — full refund, used or not.</li>
      <li>Unopened flavor cores — full refund.</li>
      <li>Opened flavor cores — refunded if returned within the same shipment.</li>
